{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0414_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0414_1000_p", "source_sha256": "f0f41c1eccc2383cc9733e1ddaa9958047bd2cf45a47a73e830c316bcc90f5c4", "ja": "（次の仕事のロケハンということで、春香と\n『幸せの鐘』が有名な観光スポットにやってきた）", "zh": "（以为下一份工作进行外景踩点为由，和春香一起来到了以“幸福之钟”闻名的旅游景点。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0414_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0414_1001_001har", "source_sha256": "1b4b9614375964fc44dbfe3f645c9cb80d22619d431e7494e0a3246754f195bb", "ja": "{$P$}さん、今日は\n付き合ってくれてありがとうございました！", "zh": "{$P$}先生，今天\n谢谢你陪我过来！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0414_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0414_1002_001har", "source_sha256": "8e29cfc70f4052294d6f490b1fd636a5af2fc8bdd3d8d436509f8e3f9b8e70b2", "ja": "私だけで来ようかとも思ってたんですけど、\n小旅行だし、ひとりはちょっと寂しくて……えへへ♪", "zh": "我本来也想着自己一个人来的，\n不过毕竟是小旅行，一个人有点寂寞嘛……嘿嘿♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0414_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0414_1003_p", "source_sha256": "1533894033d7aaaed0061722692e7f12d7fa14b114be26375b3e5fbc26f889f4", "ja": "はは、たしかに。平日なのにすごい人だったしな。\nそれになんか、心なしかカップルが多かったような？", "zh": "哈哈，确实。明明是工作日，人却多得不得了。\n而且不知怎么的，感觉情侣好像也特别多？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0414_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0414_1004_001har", "source_sha256": "5e4e2cb248f298f88716ad94dbff299bba10f209e83e765efeb0ddd26c114fa5", "ja": "あっ、えーっと、それは……。\nあの、さっき鳴らした鐘のジンクス、知ってますか？", "zh": "啊，呃，这个嘛……  \n那个，你知道刚才敲响的钟的吉兆吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0414_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0414_1005_p", "source_sha256": "74086749e6ed2911e709ae4dc330e72ccbbaeba0fb876b8ec95ead7cb21bc2f2", "ja": "ジンクス？\nあの、鳴らすと幸せになれるってやつだろ？", "zh": "吉兆？\n就是那个，据说敲响后就能获得幸福的说法吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0414_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0414_1006_001har", "source_sha256": "23a5609459f3dabbe8f4037a5f8ddd83f232de6e1564fb630e080f8c7550e09b", "ja": "はい。それと他に……あの鐘を鳴らした相手とずっと\n一緒にいられるってジンクスがあるらしいんです。", "zh": "是的。另外还有传闻说……敲响那口钟的人，就能和对方永远在一起。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0414_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0414_1007_p", "source_sha256": "00041bfb19e12035d1d36831663b6822447edbb4ddbd151ffa7b6164cebba341", "ja": "へぇ、そういうのもあるのか。\nそれなら、二人組が多いのも納得だな。", "zh": "哦，原来还有这种说法啊。\n这样一来，两人一组的组合比较多也就说得通了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0414_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0414_1008_001har", "source_sha256": "f5a91e8a43ba6d4eee5a2537b7de51905b9c397613b13e499ba7b3da058ff6c6", "ja": "はい、だから今回{$P$}さんと、\n一緒に鳴らせて良かったです！", "zh": "是的，所以这次能和{$P$}先生一起演奏，真是太好了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0414_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0414_1009_001har", "source_sha256": "0996640e3e6fe173aca4a6395de45bff0e32881595d9167b6a8477575f8a18a9", "ja": "{$P$}さんとは、\nこの先もずっと一緒にいたいですから♪", "zh": "因为我想和{$P$}先生，\n今后也一直在一起嘛♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0414_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0414_1010_001har", "source_sha256": "9857adbf86dd262b71cc1c7ae0c9a15891ed7ba82eb0939d611b63deddfc9ddd", "ja": "ああっ！？　今のはそういう意味じゃないですよ！？\n一緒にトップアイドルになりたいって言う、その……！", "zh": "啊！？刚才那句话不是那个意思哦！？\n我是说，想和你一起成为顶尖偶像……那个……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0414_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0414_1011_p", "source_sha256": "d7dc2db2986742cda75a6309bb8b3d0dcf09289d01cf7d4374f54c26f34b91b1", "ja": "うん、ありがとう。\n俺も同じように思ってるよ。", "zh": "嗯，谢谢你。\n我也有同样的想法。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0414_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0414_1012_001har", "source_sha256": "ed45234983cd3e58f81bdd4111e1f6314adbcf0ec2a40f790b27a34701b3d71d", "ja": "{$P$}さん……。\nでも、鐘に頼りきりじゃダメですよね。", "zh": "{$P$}先生……。\n但是，也不能完全依赖钟声呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0414_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0414_1013_p", "source_sha256": "e1d825864acb2300c0f937c5827cd59ff49c1297974d53460879691abbce3e42", "ja": "ん？", "zh": "嗯？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0414_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0414_1014_001har", "source_sha256": "fa3bc2e65800824b757544225c717ee485c60c172eb6df35b3dc520ce3ac93b1", "ja": "この鐘を聞いて、神様が願いを叶えてくれるんだと\nしても、毎日こんなに何人にも鳴らされてたら……。", "zh": "就算听到这钟声的神明会来实现愿望，每天被这么多人敲响这么多次的话……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0414_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0414_1015_001har", "source_sha256": "71fb28142c14cd26340c1e683fe37fa1e543bf6a72fa187ca1267509a7c6bcd6", "ja": "うっかり、ひとつぐらい忘れちゃうかもですし。\nそうなった時のためにも、自分達で叶えないと！", "zh": "说不定会一时疏忽，忘掉那么一两个愿望呢。\n为了以防万一，我们必须靠自己去实现才行！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0414_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0414_1016_p", "source_sha256": "88d760986226aa709d44f515477a3bb2f88c72ed7f7f4ebaa5313d5890564434", "ja": "あはは、そうだな。……でも、たぶん。\n春香の鳴らした鐘は忘れられないと思うよ。", "zh": "啊哈哈，说的也是。……不过，我想\n春香敲响的钟声，是绝对忘不了的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0414_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0414_1017_001har", "source_sha256": "84d8d4847bf13c7f9c3cbd82920b091ba555e2587ad6f2114fb746425ad3fa43", "ja": "え、どうしてですか？", "zh": "咦，为什么呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0414_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0414_1018_p", "source_sha256": "a595c98977721b555cd9e5933081dde24ff32b30ab6bb2f63c23e8fc876a4fef", "ja": "鳴らしてる時の春香、すごくいい笑顔だったから。\nきっと神様もファンになっちゃうんじゃないかな。", "zh": "因为春香演奏时的笑容特别棒。就连神明大概也会变成粉丝吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0414_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0414_1019_001har", "source_sha256": "d0d8cc87ee68bc9e33a1a29ecd6dd9e87a5a59f8f6246497feb7f552b679f101", "ja": "えっ！　私、そんな顔してました！？\nうう、なんだか恥ずかしいなぁ……。", "zh": "诶！我当时是那种表情吗！？\n呜，总觉得有点不好意思……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0414_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0414_1020_001har", "source_sha256": "7f10e25b49f84d9cd1228224bb8183a29480a24b4483b57450c8830270722f69", "ja": "けど、それならずっと一緒にいられますね！\nこれからもよろしくお願いします♪", "zh": "不过，这样的话，我们就能一直在一起了呢！\n今后也请多多关照♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
